### 1. Fetch Invoices List for Company A
GET http://localhost/api/invoices
Accept: application/json
X-Requested-With: XMLHttpRequest
Host: company_a.localhost

###

### 2. Create a New Invoice for Company A
POST http://localhost/api/invoices
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json
X-Requested-With: XMLHttpRequest
Host: company_a.localhost

{
    "invoice_number": "INV/2026/09/150",
    "customer_name": "International Tech Solutions Ltd",
    "customer_tax_id": "EU987654321",
    "net_amount": 2500.00,
    "vat_amount": 575.00,
    "gross_amount": 3075.00,
    "due_date": "2026-10-15"
}
